6	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	7	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	general	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	<766422318234363.1789636695.045079946517944-openerp-1-discuss.channel@fa4f0cc5629b>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>\n    Great news!<br>\n    Our company has received the Deloitte Fast 50 award.  We are the fastest\n    growing company of the country, with a growth of 1549% over the past 5\n    years. You can get more information <a href="http://www.openerp.com/node/1244/2012/10">on our blog</a>.\n</p>\n	\N	\N	t	2026-09-17 08:56:00	\N	2026-09-17 09:18:13.919388	2026-09-17 09:18:13.919388
